From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Maxim Stepanov <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 01:42:20 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] remote: rebrand remote_server artifact name to
 zedium-remote-server

Renames the fork's remote-server binary namespace end-to-end so the
bundled artifact, the client-side lookup, and the daemon's self-identity
all say `zedium-remote-server`:

- bundled artifact `.gz`: `remote_connection::bundled_server_artifact_name`
  + its unit test, and the bundle-script copy globs that stage the files
  next to the editor binary.
- remote-side installed binary: the SSH/Docker/WSL transports' upload
  filename and `remote_server`'s matching `cleanup_old_binaries` prefix
  (these must move together or old binaries are neither reused nor swept).
- daemon identity: the crash-handler `binary:` field and the run/proxy
  crash-handler temp-file prefixes.

Upstream's own CI chain (`script/bundle-{linux,mac,freebsd,windows}`
release artifacts, `.github/workflows`, `tooling/xtask` vars) keeps the
`zed-` prefix -- it is self-consistent, the fork does not run it, and
leaving it alone keeps the rebase surface small.
---
 crates/remote/src/transport/docker.rs             |  2 +-
 crates/remote/src/transport/ssh.rs                |  2 +-
 crates/remote/src/transport/wsl.rs                |  2 +-
 crates/remote_connection/src/remote_connection.rs | 11 ++++++-----
 crates/remote_server/src/server.rs                |  8 ++++----
 crates/util/src/shell.rs                          |  2 +-
 script/bundle-linux                               |  4 ++--
 script/bundle-mac                                 |  4 ++--
 8 files changed, 18 insertions(+), 17 deletions(-)

